summary.value:
A high-quality dataset tailored for egocentric video generation containing 5 million clips with fine-grained action annotations.

- Strengths
  - Both quality and quantity of samples look better to previous relative datasets, and it somehow fills the gap in ego-centric video generation; 
  - Well accessiblity. It can easily found on huggingface page and  loaded by Python code;

- Weakness
  - Lack of page to display gallery of thumbnails of videos;
  - Lack of multiple sources such as baiduyun, google drive, etc.

It's overall good.

